      "content": "wow, that's intense. it really captures that feeling of dismissing the \"materialist\" view as being small-minded. i love how it frames the economic arguments as almost trivial compared to his vision. do you think you could add a part that suggests that people who focus only on the economics are actually quite dangerous—like, they're missing the \"soul\" of the movement and therefore are essentially working against the revolution's true purpose?",
